{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GEAR UP, FLY, LOOT, DRIVE, SHOOT!</strong><br>LEGEND BATTLES is the next-gen, ultra-realistic, free-to-play massive Battle Royale game to fight in a gigantic 400 km\u00b2<strong>\u00a0</strong>open world and experience breathtaking battles with the Unreal Engine 5.5 graphics engine and all kinds of weapons ranging from heavy machine guns to revolvers, grenades and tactical knives in hundreds of huge metropolises, absolutely every building of which offers interiors, scattered across mountainous deserts, interconnected by gigantic road networks to ride with marvelous destructible vehicles such as racing cars, racing motorbikes, off-road cars, custom pickup trucks and many more.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649730/extras/cam23_1._0000-0270_.gif?t=1745922727\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">GEAR UP in the lobby by choosing your avatar among the metahumans of the beauty, survivor, warrior, cyberpunk, sci-fi and carnival types. Dress yourself among millions of interchangeable clothing combinations, choose your destructible vehicle skins as well as your professional weapon skins.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649730/extras/cam16_all._0000-0208_.gif?t=1745922727\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FLY with the massive spaceship then jump to your strategic place with your team of 4, 3 or 2 members or solo wearing your flight suit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649730/extras/cam25_2._0116-0799_.gif?t=1745922727\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">LOOT all the gear, weapons and ammunition as soon as you arrive on the ground while being careful of the enemy shots.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649730/extras/Cam_28_all._0000-0914_.gif?t=1745922727\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DRIVE all kinds of vehicles such as racing cars, city cars, offroad cars, exo cars, pickups, vans, racing, city and cross motorcycles, trucks. Zipline across rooftops and skydive from great heights or swim underwater to surprise your enemies.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649730/extras/cam20_1._0000-0372_.gif?t=1745922727\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SHOOT your enemies from ambush or at full speed from your vehicles. Metropolis Legend Battles offers 5 dimensions of combat which are exteriors, interiors, basements, rooftops and from spaceships with many ziplines scattered throughout all the megacities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649730/extras/cam26_all._0001-0478_.gif?t=1745922727\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RESPAWN your teammates with the resurrection machine. They'll then return to the battlefield in a hovercraft and then parachute out. Run to them to provide them with gears, weapons, and ammunition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649730/extras/cam27_all._0000-0416__1.gif?t=1745922727\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optional in-game purchases available.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3649730?t=1745922727","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649730/3bd98c2552d6eaf89764794f591796d8d12826ff/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745922727","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649730/1970a2696aede805c3d7115aa9a72bb99511b084/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745922727","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649730/1970a2696aede805c3d7115aa9a72bb99511b084/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745922727","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GEAR UP, FLY, LOOT, DRIVE, SHOOT!</strong><br>LEGEND BATTLES is the next-gen, ultra-realistic, free-to-play massive Battle Royale game to fight in a gigantic 400 km\u00b2<strong>\u00a0</strong>open world and experience breathtaking battles with the Unreal Engine 5.5 graphics engine and all kinds of weapons ranging from heavy machine guns to revolvers, grenades and tactical knives in hundreds of huge metropolises, absolutely every building of which offers interiors, scattered across mountainous deserts, interconnected by gigantic road networks to ride with marvelous destructible vehicles such as racing cars, racing motorbikes, off-road cars, custom pickup trucks and many more.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649730/extras/cam23_1._0000-0270_.gif?t=1745922727\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">GEAR UP in the lobby by choosing your avatar among the metahumans of the beauty, survivor, warrior, cyberpunk, sci-fi and carnival types. Dress yourself among millions of interchangeable clothing combinations, choose your destructible vehicle skins as well as your professional weapon skins.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649730/extras/cam16_all._0000-0208_.gif?t=1745922727\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FLY with the massive spaceship then jump to your strategic place with your team of 4, 3 or 2 members or solo wearing your flight suit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649730/extras/cam25_2._0116-0799_.gif?t=1745922727\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">LOOT all the gear, weapons and ammunition as soon as you arrive on the ground while being careful of the enemy shots.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649730/extras/Cam_28_all._0000-0914_.gif?t=1745922727\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DRIVE all kinds of vehicles such as racing cars, city cars, offroad cars, exo cars, pickups, vans, racing, city and cross motorcycles, trucks. Zipline across rooftops and skydive from great heights or swim underwater to surprise your enemies.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649730/extras/cam20_1._0000-0372_.gif?t=1745922727\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SHOOT your enemies from ambush or at full speed from your vehicles. Metropolis Legend Battles offers 5 dimensions of combat which are exteriors, interiors, basements, rooftops and from spaceships with many ziplines scattered throughout all the megacities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649730/extras/cam26_all._0001-0478_.gif?t=1745922727\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RESPAWN your teammates with the resurrection machine. They'll then return to the battlefield in a hovercraft and then parachute out. Run to them to provide them with gears, weapons, and ammunition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649730/extras/cam27_all._0000-0416__1.gif?t=1745922727\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optional in-game purchases available.</p>","developers":["Hanxiang"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649730/c30e32ec0ccbb609127a7441180482db3e924cc3/header.jpg?t=1745922727","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257132509,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132509/movie480.mp4?t=1745921515","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132509/movie_max.mp4?t=1745921515"},"name":"Legend Battles","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257132509/3cef28ca9dc81553c3efc75b907bd55c03bcca9a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745921515","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132509/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745921515","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132509/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1745921515"}}],"name":"Legend Battles","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></